config.py —— DX networkscript · timeitem
================================================================================

★★ this is**file**。numberOnceUsepleaseMake a copy first：

        cp config.py.example config.py          # Linux / macOS
        copy config.py.example config.py        # Windows

   After**Required**Complete Section 2「machineStageAndStore」of 6 values，Otherwise, the script sends out a request
   Bring someone else's machine ID，serverMeetings。

   ★ config.py at .gitignore in —— It belongs to your private configuration，Don't submit。
================================================================================

fileStorage**usercanneedchange**ofContent，The rest of the protocol constants are written in their respective scripts。

Split into six pieces：
  1. networkAndEncryptionConstant（AES Key、Protocol Version、server）
  2. machineStageAndStore（Keychip、Area、Store）
  3. QR loginConstant（aimedb）
  4. ★ UpsertUserAll Upcoming song data uploads（defaultTake source/2026-10-05.log real-machine sample）
  5. UpsertUserAll Safety gate
  6. log

Allatin，changeBeforepleaseLook firstBasis。
